{"id": "tatoeba-ru-0000", "text": "Моя мать всё измеряет деньгами.", "lang": "ru", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ru-0001", "text": "Я должен буду тебе перезвонить.", "lang": "ru", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ru-0002", "text": "Слишком жарко.", "lang": "ru", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ru-0003", "text": "Женщины играют в теннис.", "lang": "ru", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ru-0004", "text": "Том узнал, что Мэри богата.", "lang": "ru", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ru-0005", "text": "Я научу тебя играть в шахматы.", "lang": "ru", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ru-0006", "text": "Корзина была до краёв полна клубники.", "lang": "ru", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ru-0007", "text": "Признаю́, что он искренен.", "lang": "ru", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ru-0008", "text": "Дети и пьяницы говорят правду.", "lang": "ru", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ru-0009", "text": "Не бей меня так сильно.", "lang": "ru", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ru-0010", "text": "В стакане есть немного воды.", "lang": "ru", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ru-0011", "text": "С помощью предложений слова приобретают контекст.", "lang": "ru", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ru-0012", "text": "Предложения персонифицированы.", "lang": "ru", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ru-0013", "text": "Сладким он испортил себе желудок.", "lang": "ru", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ru-0014", "text": "Простыню и покрывало мать унесла стирать.", "lang": "ru", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ru-0015", "text": "Евреям обычно приписывают дурные качества.", "lang": "ru", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ru-0016", "text": "Эта практика называется \"антисемитизм\".", "lang": "ru", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ru-0017", "text": "Сядьте как вам удобно.", "lang": "ru", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ru-0018", "text": "По какой-то причине микрофон раньше не работал.", "lang": "ru", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
{"id": "tatoeba-ru-0019", "text": "Я не могу вынести этого шума.", "lang": "ru", "tier": "short", "source": "Tatoeba (OPUS-Tatoeba v2023-04-12 mono)", "license": "CC BY 2.0 FR", "author": "Tatoeba contributors", "url": "https://opus.nlpl.eu/Tatoeba/"}
